        [
          "python",
          "HouseAge bin edges: [ 1.  18.  29.  37.  48.  52.]\nBin counts (train):\n  Bin 0: 3303 samples\n  Bin 1: 3303 samples\n  Bin 2: 3303 samples\n  Bin 3: 3303 samples\n  Bin 4: 3300 samples\n\nWith HouseAge bins R\u00b2 (test): 0.6119\nImprovement over baseline: +0.64%"
        ]
